{"synopsis":"Jika ada pertanda bencana di Hwarang siapa lagi orangnya selain Seol Yeongrang si pengendali roh\nHwarang Seol Yeongrang dinubuatkan sebagai orang yang akan mendatangkan bencana Satusatunya cara agar dia bisa kembali ke jajarannya adalah dengan memecahkan insiden yang pada gilirannya membuktikan bahwa dia bukanlah pertanda yang digambarkan\nDan saat dia berkelana seorang pria gila misterius bernama Zaha muncul\nDi era Silla tempat manusia yokai dan roh berkeliaran requiem hwarang terungkap","alternative_title":"鎭魂記, 진혼기, Subdued Soul Chronicle","author":"Jung Yeon (II), Mogin","artist":"Oh Wolrang","chapters":[{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"1ae59873-0d9b-4e5b-bfe3-a011c1cbdb40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2025-05-21"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"7bd240e8-af7d-4b11-b1f6-b5a13247479d","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2025-05-13"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"e2a92d80-f11b-409e-8e49-4853bb5ccc5f","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2025-05-12"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"bfdb269b-8ccd-4bbd-9d2b-6d69f69603a4","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2025-05-11"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"d7bb62d8-8ba1-496d-8dd9-179a8321aca3","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2025-05-10"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"552bf8fb-9f0e-462c-a6a0-a8a62922cc63","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2025-05-09"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"083f9c48-a0aa-402b-bbfe-dd8765092a09","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2025-05-08"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"35bba8da-739d-4d1a-908d-1ea4ec177a72","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2025-05-07"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"28a633e6-e604-4b83-8dc3-28710c28a2d1","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2025-05-06"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"d30fecc4-8039-44db-8034-074a79a5df20","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2025-05-06"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"83a268ba-9a47-46fd-bf55-ea2ed956eb90","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2025-04-26"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"79a13642-0f2c-4469-80de-e38ca3279